{
  "id": "buffer_solutions",
  "title": "Buffer Solutions Calculator",
  "description": "A comprehensive tool for calculating buffer solution pH and composition using the Henderson-Hasselbalch equation. Determine pH for a given buffer, find required acid/base ratios for target pH, and analyze buffer capacity.",
  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Buffer Solutions Calculator\n\nUse this tool to calculate buffer solution properties using the **Henderson-Hasselbalch equation**:\n\n**pH = pKa + log((base) / (acid))**\n\nWhere:\n- **pKa**: Negative logarithm of the acid dissociation constant\n- **base**: Concentration of the conjugate base or salt (A⁻)\n- **acid**: Concentration of the weak acid (HA)\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n- The **best buffering effect** is achieved when the (A⁻)/(HA) ratio is 1 (pH = pKa)\n- **Buffer capacity** depends on the magnitude of both [A⁻] and [HA] concentrations\n- Choose an acid/base with pKa **closest to your target pH**"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "pKa",
          "label": "pKa (Acid Dissociation Constant)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 4.76,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "base_conc",
          "label": "Base/Salt Concentration (A⁻)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.25,
          "unit": "M"
        },
        {
          "id": "acid_conc",
          "label": "Acid Concentration (HA)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.4,
          "unit": "M"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "pH",
          "label": "pH",
          "formula": "inputs.pKa + (Math.log10(inputs.base_conc / inputs.acid_conc))",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "ratio",
          "label": "Base/Acid Ratio",
          "formula": "inputs.base_conc / inputs.acid_conc",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pOH",
          "label": "pOH",
          "formula": "14 - (inputs.pKa + Math.log10(inputs.base_conc / inputs.acid_conc))",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "target_pH",
          "label": "Target pH",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 4.5,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "pKa_target",
          "label": "pKa of Weak Acid",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 4.2,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "acid_concentration",
          "label": "Acid Concentration",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "M"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "required_ratio",
          "label": "Required [Base]/[Acid] Ratio",
          "formula": "Math.pow(10, (inputs.target_pH - inputs.pKa_target))",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "required_base_conc",
          "label": "Required Base Concentration",
          "formula": "inputs.acid_concentration * Math.pow(10, (inputs.target_pH - inputs.pKa_target))",
          "unit": "M",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "pH_difference",
          "label": "pH vs pKa Difference",
          "formula": "inputs.target_pH - inputs.pKa_target",
          "unit": "",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Acid",
